<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <p xml:id="Aink155-kilavi">
        parattaiyiṭattu vāyilviṭṭu oḻukukiṉṟa talaimakaṉatu vāyilāy vantārkkut tōḻivāyiṉmaṟuttatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
        The confidante denying entry to the talaimakaṉ who, having departed from the entrance of the other woman, [now] came through his [own] entrance [to the marital house?].
  </p>
</div>    
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink156">
<l>veḷḷāṅ kurukiṉ piḷḷai cetteṉak</l>
<l>kāṇiya ceṉṟa maṭanaṭai nārai</l>
<l>pataippa voḻinta cemmaṟut tūvi</l>
<l>teṇkaḻip parakkun tuṟaiva</l>
<l>ṉeṉakkō kātala ṉaṉaikkō vēṟē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The man from the ghat in which the red-spotted feathers</l>
          <l>that were left behind by the wader with an inexperienced walk - as it trembled -</l>
            <l>That went to see, since the hatchling of the white wader died,</l>
              <l>Spread in the clear backwaters, is, to me, [her] lover.</l>
                <l>[However,] to [my] female companion, he is something else. [Alternate translation:] </l>
                  <l>To me, he is a lover. To all [others], he is something else.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
